# deploy/partner_sync_carveouts — the partner-only files an owner→partner sync
# MUST NEVER overwrite (each is pinned by a deploy/ test). One path per line,
# '#' starts a comment, blank lines are ignored. The sync drops these paths and
# keeps the partner copy. Sorted.
# The whole workflows dir: the sync job's GITHUB_TOKEN can never push a change to
# any .github/workflows/* file (GitHub refuses without the 'workflows' permission),
# so one vl workflow edit used to REFUSE the entire sync (docker-build.yml 10-20,
# pr-go-test-coverage.yml 10-26). Workflow changes are brought over by a normal PR.
